      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alexandria%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "When the canal fell into disuse in 1875, the Pennsylvania Railroad stepped in to keep Alexandria connected.",
